---
layout: page.njk
lang: "he"
locale: "he-IL"
dir: "rtl"
lang_url: "/"
title: "Worth It Studio | צרי קשר"
description: "צרי קשר עם Worth It Studio - אשמח לשמוע ממך ולענות על כל שאלה"
translationKey: "contact"
shareImage: "/img/worth-it-logo-square-updated.svg"
eleventyNavigation:
    order: 6
    key: "צרי קשר"
---
<script src="{{ '/scripts/contact.js' | url }}" defer></script>

<main class="contact-page">
    <div class="panel">
        <h1>{{ "contact_page_title" | i18n({}, locale) }}</h1>
        <p>יש לך שאלה? רוצה לשמוע עוד? סתם מתלבטת?<br>אני כאן.</p>
        <blockquote>
            {{ "contact_page_quote" | i18n({}, locale) }}
        </blockquote>
        <div class="info">
            <a href="tel:0545845515">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>
                <span>054-584-5515</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/hadas.worth.it/" target="_blank">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"></line></svg>
                <span>hadas.worth.it</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-side">
        <h2>{{ "contact_form_heading" | i18n({}, locale) }}</h2>
        <form name="contact" method="POST" action="/contact/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" class="contact-form">
            <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
            <p style="display:none"><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>

            <div class="field">
                <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder=" " required>
                <label for="name">{{ "contact_form_name" | i18n({}, locale) }}</label>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
                <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder=" " required>
                <label for="phone">{{ "contact_form_phone" | i18n({}, locale) }}</label>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder=" ">
                <label for="email">{{ "contact_form_email" | i18n({}, locale) }}</label>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
                <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder=" " rows="1"></textarea>
                <label for="message">{{ "contact_form_message" | i18n({}, locale) }}</label>
            </div>

            <button type="submit">{{ "contact_form_submit" | i18n({}, locale) }}</button>
        </form>

        <div class="contact-message" data-success-message>
            <p>{{ "contact_form_success" | i18n({}, locale) }}</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>
